WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.021
Remember our earlier shapes?

00:00:02.021 --> 00:00:07.000
Cubes became boxes, spheres became apples, and cylinders became cups.

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:11.300
Today, let's try the cone: a round base that rises to a point.

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:16.600
You'll spot it in an ice-cream cone, a party hat, and the pointed nose of a rocket.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:21.300
Watch your teacher build the big shape first, then curve the base into an ellipse.

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:25.750
Add light and shadow, and those flat marks start to feel round.

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:29.035
Another simple shape, so many possibilities.

00:00:29.035 --> 00:00:30.246
Grab your pencil.

00:00:30.246 --> 00:00:31.600
Let's give it a go!

